{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今（25日）網上流傳一段短片，一輛疑持P牌的電單車在荃灣路往屯門方向行駛，期間前方路段塞車，其前面的私家車亦見狀煞車，惟電單車懷疑未有即時反應，收掣不及撞向前車，司機受衝擊失平衡跌落車，電單車亦倒地，當時旁邊剛好有一輛貨車駛過，十分驚險，帖主直指「死神差d（啲）來了」。</p><p>警方於昨（24日）晚上11時許接獲報案，指荃灣路往屯門方向發生交通意外，涉及一輛電單車及一輛私家車，事件中無人受傷。</p><figure><img alt=\"（CourteousFlamingo7410／車cam L（香港群組））\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1190879492726329344976183.png/PLzamIWxZy6OafWvYL_Eefj4nYR7GIQPs3sS87N7EvM\"/><figcaption>（CourteousFlamingo7410／車cam L（香港群組））</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（CourteousFlamingo7410／車cam L（香港群組））\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1190879495184322560981460.png/JP2lMXDCStdTrlOAgN-kZDDNSSlJCRwU3_lGk9_5RpM\"/><figcaption>（CourteousFlamingo7410／車cam L（香港群組））</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（CourteousFlamingo7410／車cam L（香港群組））\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1190879497814282240709345.png/p0b6676Ax_OV7JZeOcU1nQeltewXO17Z2nw6J9p8Oic\"/><figcaption>（CourteousFlamingo7410／車cam L（香港群組））</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（CourteousFlamingo7410／車cam L（香港群組））\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1190879500108697600351270.png/9_22yj9x_9qAE5dj0G6_9mYwTa0xjHKh__yUHv_8lB4\"/><figcaption>（CourteousFlamingo7410／車cam L（香港群組））</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T20:39:53.867903+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T20:24:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:38:15.496900+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:38:05.890997+00:00","content_hash":"bb3ba8e8c74ca27a47bde2ad08110a0688a8bc0924a78d49e8dca83cd6efa527","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}